{"server":"tw","storyId":"act13d0_level_act13d0_st06","groupId":"act13d0","stageId":null,"title":"交錯光影","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d0/level_act13d0_st06.txt","sourceHash":"5df637f6c5424c76cd81da319fa4df8a004968118d083acbf27d6553b5c1ed7e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"交错光影"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女士們，先生們，歡迎各位今夜到來，下面讓我們觀賞本劇團的最新劇本！\n這盛大的劇本您絕不會在其他地方見到，獨佔、專屬，正是只存在於此的至福享受！\n請洗淨您的雙眼，磨尖您的聽覺，享受這個美妙的夜晚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"歡迎各位來到猩紅劇團——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（輕聲唱歌）"},{"type":"narration","text":"Answer.\nThe shadow in the dark."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是誰。誰在黑夜中喚我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"時候到了，我該準備登台。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Answer.\nThe shadow in the dark.\nThe killer on the stage."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"誰在說話。誰在唱歌。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Answer.\nYour darkness is asking."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"帷幕拉開，燈光垂落，演員站在中央。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼聲音，是誰在期待，是誰在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——喝彩。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"But\nIn the fact who you are.\nWho you are.\nThe shadow in the dark."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_stage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我是黑夜中的幽靈，布幕後的幻影，舞台上的明星。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你是誰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你藏在破屋裡，你躲在長桌後，你把自己塞在那些惡魔的言語和漆黑字符下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你和我們一起唱歌，我們時常練習，你唱得最好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不是這齣戲的演員，那麼又為什麼會出現在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你們......認得我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你問我們是誰，你竟已經不認得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼能夠忘記？怎麼膽敢忘記？魔鬼選中你，教你音樂，教你念詞，教你領略這舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你著了魔，追隨魔鬼的指引，可在最後卻又背棄。你殺了魔鬼，離開這裡，現在已將我們都忘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你真認為自己能殺掉魔鬼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是這樣，我沒有忘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經將所有人都殺死。那些人的做法是錯誤的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"沉溺是錯誤的，追隨是錯誤的，覺得美是錯誤的，我必須要殺掉他們，我必須這樣做——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你殺死了他們，同時也奪走我們的呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就在這舞台上，你開始唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你們早已經被我殺死，為什麼還會出現在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"久違了，我們親愛的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們一起背井離鄉，我們一起長大。我們是流淌著不同血的親人，同吃同住，卻走向不同的結局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已經很久沒和你說過話，自從蠟燭融化，我的血液和燭淚一起滴在舞台上，自那之後，我們就再沒有說過話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"與你不同，無緣領略藝術真諦的演員，不過是篩選後的失敗品，空有喜愛，卻無才華。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而有人撲火，有人選擇逃離。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也有人仍停留在過去，在那個夜裡。歌聲響起，歌聲一直未停息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......時間到了。屬於過去的幻影不會在這裡停留太久，我們不該在這舞台上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！別走——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"咳——咳、呃，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我的......喉嚨......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"多可悲，午夜的幽靈，分不清自己。失去歌喉，你還剩下什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"逃離這裡，又真的能逃離今夜嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不該出聲。你不該唱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"演員A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不該在這舞台上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"Answer.\nThe shadow in the dark.\nAnswer.\nWho you are.\nAnd what you really desire."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"女士們，先生們，帷幕已落下......\n希望各位能夠有一個美好的夜晚......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......我是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我、想要......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"08:10 A.M.  天氣/陰雨\n羅德島艦船，第二艙室，人事後勤部門"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這一批的幹員應該都在這裡了，1、2、3......好，沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？這個是......這個編號怎麼是上一批的，是誰整理的時候這麼不小心，居然編號都能弄混。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"傀影？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"誰啊，我怎麼不記得還有這個幹員。嗯？這檔案怎麼還缺了一部分？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"怪了，這是什麼情況啊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"已經習慣艦內的生活了嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"是的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然也還有一些不是很明白的地方，但是天火學姐一直很照顧我，沒問題的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了，博士，天火學姐給我的幹員手冊，我已經全部讀完了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"裡面記了好多注意事項，每一條都寫得很清楚，讀起來又有意思，這個到底是誰寫的呀，作者真的很厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，食堂的飯菜很好吃，天火學姐說我都胖了一圈了，強行塞給了我一張芙蓉小姐的健康餐宣傳單，但學姐自己明明吃得也不少嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，還有啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對不起，博士，我是不是說得太多了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不會。看來你已經很適應了，我很高興。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿嘿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的大家都很和善，也很照顧我，真的很開心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想趕快變得可靠起來，如果能幫上大家的忙就最好不過了。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"對不起，對不起，果然是我的話太多惹人煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，今後我會注意的......"}]},{"label":"沒關係。其實你學姐也胖了。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"對吧！我也覺得！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，可不能讓學姐聽到哦，天火學姐生氣起來，真的會把博士的辦公室燒掉的......"}]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"//敲门"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，有人來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"請進。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"//开门\n//脚步声"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾了，博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有一份檔案需要確認，您現在有時間嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"凱爾希醫生和阿米婭說，關於這件事可以來這裡找您處理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"讓我看看吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（將檔案資料遞給博士）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這一份檔案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"這位幹員傀影相關背景的記錄並不完整，有不少資訊都缺失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道之前的負責人是哪一位......人事部門的工作記錄表上並沒有署名，大概是工作疏漏吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"最近正好因為多了不少新人，我們那裡在著手整理目前在籍的所有幹員的資料，像這樣的遺漏其實還有不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然也不是什麼大問題，但是還是得要逐一補齊才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來好像很辛苦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"如果有需要的話，我也可以幫忙哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，我是術師小組的新成員，代號薄綠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我記得你，是之前任務途中和大家走散了的那個新人吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，天火小姐發了很大脾氣呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚，非常抱歉，給大家添麻煩了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"學姐一定也很生我的氣，之後狠狠罵了我一頓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？不是哦，並不是生你的氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"天火小姐是因為自己沒有注意到後輩的狀態，而在生自己的氣......至少她當時是這麼說的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？學姐她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"天火小姐對他人有時會有點嚴格，是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但實際上她對自己會更加嚴格，就像上次的事一樣，比起埋怨別人，她第一時間就會先反思自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"明明那也不能怪她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說，見過她對自己的要求標準，就會產生一種確實是自己太不像樣了的感覺，偶爾被說兩句，好像也沒什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯！學姐確實是這樣的人，在這一點上，我相當敬佩學姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，看出來了。總之，謝謝你願意來幫忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"最近我們確實吸收了許多新鮮血液，不管是我們這裡還是醫療部門和後勤部門，大家都有點忙不過來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，對了，說回幹員傀影的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"之前提到了，其實有不少幹員的檔案都存在一些需要補足的地方，一般來說，小問題的話我們都是直接找到本人，問清楚就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，這位幹員傀影的情況有一些特殊......坦白說，我們根本無法輕易找到他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"這位先生是目前不在艦內嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不，根據任務記錄來看，對方現在並沒有外勤任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員傀影本人似乎一直在有意避開和其他幹員碰面，再加上他的源石技藝，想要找到他不怎麼容易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然也可以在一些地方蹲守，或者去找可露希爾小姐幫忙......但是目前人手不足，總是等著不是辦法，而後者嘛，嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說之前對方加入的時候鬧出了點意外，已經惹到可露希爾小姐了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"最好還是不要讓可露希爾小姐有機會公報私仇吧？會發生什麼真的很難想像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"聽起來好難......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"這位傀影先生的源石技藝，是像伊桑先生一樣嗎？還有......呃我看看手冊，對了，還有獅蠍小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"獅蠍小姐也有隱藏行蹤的能力吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯，我記得獅蠍小姐剛加入的時候，大家也是費了不少功夫，才終於做完了記錄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟很可能只要稍微一眨眼，就再也注意不到獅蠍小姐了，真的很難以處理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"獅蠍本人也很苦惱。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"確實是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"當時我們只能在紙條上和獅蠍小姐透過書寫來交流，真的費了不少功夫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，至少在主觀意願上，獅蠍小姐還是非常願意配合我們的。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"看這個反應......博士也還記得吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"上回博士差點就忘記獅蠍小姐還在房間裡，直接把門給鎖上了。"}]},{"label":"可能她現在就在這間房間裡。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？！獅蠍小姐在這裡嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎，博士？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是開玩笑的吧？真是的，博士，別隨便亂開這種玩笑啊......"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"比起獅蠍小姐的無可奈何，幹員傀影的話，感覺就只是單純的在用自己的源石技藝，避開所有人而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"關於這件事，凱爾希醫生和阿米婭都說可以來找博士幫忙，博士，你有什麼好主意嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不是完全沒辦法。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？太好了，要怎麼才能找到對方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"這種時候，一般我們需要徵求女士的意見。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你是指......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"又是那個夢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上的舞台，還有那些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（......不，不對。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（那一天，那個晚上沒有發生這種事，一切都很順利。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（他們不會再出現。他們不該再出現。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（......亡靈，已經被我殺死。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"流淌不止的河流在我耳邊唱出樂聲，向我沖刷，離我遠去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"或許從未有人真正離去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯？有腳步聲，這個聲音是......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"//开门声"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"喵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"是你啊，Ms.Christine。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"喵~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你看起來心情不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"喵，喵嗷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，已經習慣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那些幻影，那些視線一直都在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"咪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，我知道還有其他客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"——博士。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"早上好。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"陰雨天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"這個早晨恐怕不太美妙。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"}]},{"label":"又是聽腳步聲就能知道是誰？","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"人們踏出的每一步，沉重或輕快，急促或舒緩，都會透露出許多訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"想要區分並不困難。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"除了你，還有其他人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"有兩個陌生的腳步聲，一個輕些，另一個笨重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"//脚步声\n//脚步声"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，被發現了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"真厲害，我還特地走得很小心呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"確實是敏銳到可怕的聽覺......哎，笨重的那個是說我嗎？我最近確實是胖了點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，我覺得這不是在說體重的問題啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"說吧，來找我有什麼事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"Ms.Christine很少帶客人來，看來你確實很受青睞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我很榮幸。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Ms.Christine","speakerId":"avg_npc_130","isRemote":false,"text":"喵，喵嗚~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，Ms.Christine在表達贊同。"}]},{"label":"你剛剛躲在哪裡？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有躲藏，只是眼睛在欺騙你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"眼、耳、喉、鼻，所有的感官都會騙人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......甚至連回憶也會。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，總算是見到面了。您好，幹員傀影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我是人事部的工作人員，您留存在人事部的檔案有一部分沒有完整錄入，這次打擾是有一些問題想要重新確認一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"檔案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。羅德島想知道些什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝您的配合。不用擔心，只需要您回答一些簡單的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，在此之前，請先容我確認一下您的源石技藝控制狀態。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"為傀影先生特製的監控設備目前在使用上有出現什麼問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"特別是平常使用的時候......比如說現在這樣對話，源石技藝會有任何脫離控制的傾向嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"根據傀影先生的回報，如果有需要，技術部門後續將會為您調整設備的相應功能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"不必，現在這樣就足夠了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"一定程度上對結晶的抑制，以及針對波長和幅度的調整，這些功能都非常有用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"只要不將音節連成旋律，就沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......多謝你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"不用客氣，輔助幹員們控制自己的源石技藝，也是我們該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼問題那就太好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼接下來......是關於傀影先生的出生地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次錄入資料時，據您所說，您的出生地是在維多利亞西北部的克萊布拉松地區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊布拉松......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"沒錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......這就奇怪了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"根據您提供的資訊，我們在維多利亞的辦事處派人前往當地進行了核實，但是從結果來看，現實情況似乎和傀影先生所說的有一些出入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，是不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_stage"},{"type":"narration","text":"舞台落幕了。\n那些布料上滲出了血。\n鮮花被踩爛在地上。\n怎麼回事？\n有什麼東西發出碎裂聲，是晚餐時的玻璃杯。\n櫃門開始掉漆。街邊的人在笑。\n番茄落在地上，花被人踩過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"風把鋼琴吹響。\n悶熱，舞台上的燈光刺破黑色的布。\n觀眾在路邊鼓掌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——巷子裡的人是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"怎麼回事？\n怎麼回事？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"——在笑的人，是誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"克萊布拉松。是不是根本就不存在？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我們的調查人員沒有找到類似名稱的移動城市，或者區域......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"傀影先生，我必須要提醒您，如果您不想公開自己的出身地，可以有其他選擇，申請暫時保密或是設置相應查看權限都沒有問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果在這份基礎資料上說了謊，那麼事情的性質就完全不同了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"我們可以容許幹員對一些資訊進行隱藏、保密，直接拒絕回答都行，但是謊言......這對我們雙方建立信賴關係沒有任何好處。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"您能明白嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......不是謊言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"錄入時我說的是實話，並沒有欺騙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"曾經收留我的人告訴過我，我出生在那裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那個人說，我們的村莊被天災摧毀，田地被戰火席捲，四處流浪的劇團恰巧在這時路過，失去家園的孩子們得以被劇團收留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"之後，我們跟隨劇團離開......再也沒有回去過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"除了這個名字外，我對那片土地一無所知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"真的很奇怪，這到底是怎麼一回事......會不會是您的長輩弄錯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"或者，有沒有可能是傀影先生記錯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或許是弄錯了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"這件事可以之後再驗證。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，也只能先這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"總之，只要不是故意欺騙，這些基礎資訊可以先做特殊處理，之後再補充或修改也沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，可以這樣嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為不管在哪裡，這種檔案都會做得相當嚴格呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"維多利亞的大學在這方面就相當嚴厲，如果在檔案出現問題，嚴重的甚至可能會被退學！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"一般來說，確實是會比較嚴格的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"但是羅德島的人員構成比較特殊，事情也不能做得那麼絕對......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"例如小蛇屠箱那樣的例子，她自己確實什麼都不記得了，我們也沒有辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一些有特殊情況的幹員，在判斷對方對羅德島沒有危害之後，還是會適當通融的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？啊，不用，不用客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"剛剛說的情況屬實的話，這事也不能算是傀影先生的錯......總之，我們之後會再嘗試去查找一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"如果仍然沒有結果，這件事我會如實上報，交由上面來判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"也不用太擔心，阿米婭在這方面一向不太計較的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，讓我看看還有什麼......啊，對了，請問傀影先生加入羅德島的動機是什麼？這個姑且也是需要詢問一下的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"您是感染者，那果然還是為了礦石病的治療？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"找人？是我們的幹員嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能確定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我在找一個人。有一件事，我要查清楚，所以我必須要找到那個知情的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那些來自過去的鬼魂，就站在街角，在窗外，在我身邊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"那些東西，我必須擺脫它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"只有找到那些真正的過去，才能徹底解決它。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"這是在說什麼呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，您怎麼確定要找的人就在羅德島呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到音樂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我聽到聲音，那聲音讓我到這兒來，這裡有我想要的線索。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"答案就在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（博士，博士！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"人事幹員","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"（這位傀影幹員真的沒問題？看起來很不妙啊，真的不需要去醫療部門再檢查一下？？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"（礦石病確實有影響聽覺，甚至神經和思維的病例，傀影先生難道也是嗎......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我認為他的情況不完全是礦石病的影響。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"你在說什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"沒什麼","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"對了，從剛剛起就有一個問題想問。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你掛在衣櫃門上的那件衣服，很顯眼，是過去的戲服嗎？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"......你說什麼？衣櫃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"我並沒有——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"這件衣服，是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼......什麼時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"傀影","speakerId":"char_250_phantom","isRemote":false,"text":"它不該出現在這裡——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_stage"},{"type":"narration","text":"塞在櫃子裡的花束。\n綠色的陰雲。\n長出眼睛的水泥柱，融化的樹葉。兩邊全是坐席。\n掌聲雷動。街邊的行人喝彩。\n垃圾罐站起來跳舞，誰在唱歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"誰在唱歌。\n——誰在唱歌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那些衣服上滲出紅色，花被踩碎在地上。\n坐席上沒有人。\n街邊沒有人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_corridor"},{"type":"narration","text":"//脚步声"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"（克萊布拉松，克萊布拉松，好奇怪，總覺得好像在什麼地方聽過這個地名......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗯......是在哪兒來著。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"哎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"完全想不起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"算啦，之後去借點書來查查看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊，抱歉，是不是嚇到你了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你是......新來的幹員吧，是遇到了什麼麻煩嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"對、對不起，不是您的問題，是我反應過度了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是有一點想不明白的問題，稍微發了會呆......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？有什麼我可以幫你的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"請不要客氣，就當做是嚇到你的賠禮吧。如果願意，可以和我說說你的煩惱，如果有什麼我可以幫得上忙的，就再好不過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝......您真是個好人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島果然大家都很親切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，多謝誇獎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你之前在說，想不起來的是什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"原來您聽到了呀。我是在想一個地名......克萊布拉松。我總覺得像是聽過，但就是想不起是在哪裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"您有聽說過這個地方嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......真令人熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有想到，還能聽到這個名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您知道這個地方嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"當然。我當然知道這個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很久之前，我曾經生活在那片土地上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我從他人的口中聽說了它的名字，屬於現在的人是不會提起這個名字的，只有早該被埋葬在過去的枯朽殘骸還會記得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那個人和他口中的一切，分明都已經腐爛在過去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薄綠","speakerId":"char_388_mint","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，有些偏題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你有時間聽故事嗎？如果有時間，我可以給你說一個故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"關於克萊布拉松，關於那裡的人，關於一些親人失去庇護的孩子，以及路過小村莊的流浪劇團......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我可以全都說給你聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們換一個安靜些的地方吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅德島幹員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......那會是一個很長的故事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["人事幹員"]},{"speakerId":"char_250_phantom","aliases":["傀影"]},{"speakerId":"char_388_mint","aliases":["薄綠"]}]}
